{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/3e81b01891146cad9248959f3685a25a.avif?t=1768471787\" width=780 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Fantasy <i>Puzzle-Platformer</i> for <i>Co-op</i> Lovers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the spellbinding world of <i>Weeny Wise</i>, where cooperation and exploration are essential to survival! Take on the role of two brave adventurers, Anneli and Hugo, as they explore a vast, magical world filled with hidden secrets, an original lore, and a variety of puzzles and platforming challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins as the dark sorcerer Ragna returns after years, wielding a powerful talisman to rally the Weeny Wise in a war that could endanger the entire human race or Weeny Wise. But yet, there\u2019s a glimmer of hope with Anneli and Hugo, young students at a magical school who survived Ragna\u2019s initial attack. Together, they embark on a quest to find the Four Seals of imprisoned magic, a path that may be their last chance to end Ragna's plans and save both Weeny Wise and humans from war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/4225bef554aa03d1246b2ba5c9523595.poster.avif?t=1768471787\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/4225bef554aa03d1246b2ba5c9523595.webm?t=1768471787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/4225bef554aa03d1246b2ba5c9523595.mp4?t=1768471787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/0303260cb103955032b34978aa7e3495.avif?t=1768471787\" width=613 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>co-op</strong> game, Weeny Wise is played with two main characters. You must, with the help of a friend, navigate through the storyline and game levels. <strong>Single-player advancement in the game is not feasible!</strong> (It is currently planned that all copies purchased will come with an additional copy you can gift to a friend, at <strong>no extra charge!</strong>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/e84992a4775c8176f85028eea0414ac6.poster.avif?t=1768471787\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/e84992a4775c8176f85028eea0414ac6.webm?t=1768471787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/e84992a4775c8176f85028eea0414ac6.mp4?t=1768471787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/8c2a935001fb70253f826d9db33a8afb.avif?t=1768471787\" width=613 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the world of Weeny Wise you will encounter various magical stones. These stones will give you different abilities needed to both advance in the game, and be a good companion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/1b40de7eb253ce762238b51a1a606974.poster.avif?t=1768471787\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/1b40de7eb253ce762238b51a1a606974.webm?t=1768471787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/1b40de7eb253ce762238b51a1a606974.mp4?t=1768471787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/48517c219bfaf38b8c995aa1c070108e.avif?t=1768471787\" width=613 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you enter the world of <i>Weeny Wise</i>, you will have the opportunity to fully explore the <strong>Sentinels' Realm</strong> and parts of the <strong>Initials</strong> and <strong>Icicles</strong> realms. Use your abilities to uncover hidden items, information, and events as you progress through these magical lands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/e6bb29e6af7cba943107830193573e65.poster.avif?t=1768471787\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/e6bb29e6af7cba943107830193573e65.webm?t=1768471787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/e6bb29e6af7cba943107830193573e65.mp4?t=1768471787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/6d124cd72b5747e57a60acc297655736.avif?t=1768471787\" width=613 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regna has enchanted some creatures to protect her position and you have to hide, escape, or even fight them with the help of your companion and  magical abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/9c45d4203b9b0508510d55c3d56cc0dd.poster.avif?t=1768471787\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/9c45d4203b9b0508510d55c3d56cc0dd.webm?t=1768471787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/9c45d4203b9b0508510d55c3d56cc0dd.mp4?t=1768471787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/0d170f46fe5d2ca3446c2c4d6f28485e.avif?t=1768471787\" width=613 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can team up with your companion in a dedicated section to experience exciting and diverse mini-games, competing together or against other teams.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/3186dbd9286ed5814c0dc3a1e556ffe0.poster.avif?t=1768471787\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/3186dbd9286ed5814c0dc3a1e556ffe0.webm?t=1768471787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/3186dbd9286ed5814c0dc3a1e556ffe0.mp4?t=1768471787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2820270?t=1768471787","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/6740f04a6cea42cdc52d648c78cdee2ee123ba4e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768471787","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/e299c65dbc2d08cb386ea954349b6206c2ab6556/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768471787","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/e299c65dbc2d08cb386ea954349b6206c2ab6556/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768471787","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/3e81b01891146cad9248959f3685a25a.avif?t=1768471787\" width=780 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Fantasy <i>Puzzle-Platformer</i> for <i>Co-op</i> Lovers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the spellbinding world of <i>Weeny Wise</i>, where cooperation and exploration are essential to survival! Take on the role of two brave adventurers, Anneli and Hugo, as they explore a vast, magical world filled with hidden secrets, an original lore, and a variety of puzzles and platforming challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins as the dark sorcerer Ragna returns after years, wielding a powerful talisman to rally the Weeny Wise in a war that could endanger the entire human race or Weeny Wise. But yet, there\u2019s a glimmer of hope with Anneli and Hugo, young students at a magical school who survived Ragna\u2019s initial attack. Together, they embark on a quest to find the Four Seals of imprisoned magic, a path that may be their last chance to end Ragna's plans and save both Weeny Wise and humans from war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/4225bef554aa03d1246b2ba5c9523595.poster.avif?t=1768471787\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/4225bef554aa03d1246b2ba5c9523595.webm?t=1768471787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/4225bef554aa03d1246b2ba5c9523595.mp4?t=1768471787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/0303260cb103955032b34978aa7e3495.avif?t=1768471787\" width=613 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>co-op</strong> game, Weeny Wise is played with two main characters. You must, with the help of a friend, navigate through the storyline and game levels. <strong>Single-player advancement in the game is not feasible!</strong> (It is currently planned that all copies purchased will come with an additional copy you can gift to a friend, at <strong>no extra charge!</strong>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video